            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Yes, this is intentional. Registry entries accept only a single table which is picker's `local_opts`. This is (somewhat) documented in the [`:h :Pick`](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/034698a100e91fd5798b27c2927378eb5b06615a/doc/mini-pick.txt#L668-L671), the fact that `MiniPick.registry` is [source for `:Pick` subcommands](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/034698a100e91fd5798b27c2927378eb5b06615a/doc/mini-pick.txt#L1217), and [this example](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/034698a100e91fd5798b27c2927378eb5b06615a/doc/mini-pick.txt#L1231-L1236).",
