        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Ah, I think I see. The registry is user-accessible so users can add pickers to it, but it's really only meant to be _used_ by the Pick command. I was using pickers through the registry in my own config (because I had just learned about it; new thing to try 🙂), but I should have just been accessing the pickers directly.",
